<title>DENMARK: Lauritzen H1 results due Aug 29.</title>
<headline>Lauritzen H1 results due Aug 29.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish shipping group J.Lauritzen A/S said its first-half 1996 results, originally scheduled for Wednesday, will now be published on Thursday, August 29.</p>
<p>A company statement said that board discussion on the results was incomplete and would resume on Thursday morning. --Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
</text>
